{#- Site background: a vignette, a fixed two-scale grid, and one aurora band.
    Decorative only — aria-hidden, pointer-events none, behind the content.
    The vignette and grid never move, so the page keeps its depth with motion
    off; only the aurora animates, and it freezes under reduced motion. -#}
<div class="site-bg" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="site-bg__vignette"></div>
  <div class="site-bg__grid"></div>
  <div class="site-bg__aurora"></div>
</div>
